OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRain quickly
OL,6,Fclears away northeast, then drier for
OL,7,Fa time in the evening before further
OL,8,Foutbreaks of heavy rain arrive. Windy
OL,9,Feverywhere with southerly gales along
OL,10,Fthe east Aberdeenshire coast.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FRather cloudy with further
OL,13,Fshowers, some heavy, but drier and
OL,14,Fbrighter across northeast
OL,15,FAberdeenshire. A very windy day with
OL,16,Fsouthwesterly gales.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
